OL,3,GFEATURESCNetwork BBC TV Presentation:
OL,4,Cslow to embrace female voices
OL,5,
OL,6,FThis Saturday BBC Four will devote its
OL,7,Fentire evening to celebrating the
OL,8,Fcareer of Angela Rippon.
OL,10,FFrom the original Top Gear to Come
OL,11,FDancing through to Rip-Off Britain, her
OL,12,Fachievements are huge.
OL,14,FBut, of course, her greatest
OL,15,Fachievement is the one which earned her
OL,16,Fa place in broadcasting history. Angela
OL,17,Fwas the first woman to become
OL,18,Festablished as a network newsreader.
OL,20,FShe was not, as some think, the first
OL,21,Fwoman newsreader.
OL,23,APub: 06-Oct-2024Qpppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BRewind CNat Radio FNat Sport
FL,137,120,200,300,0,100
